From 1c048fd0db6336e9b1abf2e8c945604012a6a1e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 10 Jun 2026 10:02:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] feat(frontend): visual league picker with crests,
 staleness badge and refresh-all
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Backend
- New POST /leagues/refresh-all endpoint (sequential, ~30s, rate-limit safe).
- LeagueOut now exposes last_updated so the UI can flag stale data.

Frontend
- MatchSelector: league dropdown replaced by a grid of crest tiles (2-4 cols
  responsive), with selected league highlighted.
- New 'Atualizar todas' button next to 'Apenas esta liga'.
- Team selects now show the team crest next to the dropdown, and the
  versus header includes both crests.
- League card shows a relative 'atualizado há Xd' badge that turns yellow
  once data is 3+ days old.
